## BAHAGIAN 3: CIRI LANJUTAN GITHUB ACTIONS

### 3.1 Matrix Strategy
```yaml
strategy:
  fail-fast: false
  matrix:
    os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest]
    node-version: [18.x, 20.x, 22.x]
    exclude:
      - os: macos-latest
        node-version: 18.x
```

### 3.2 Caching Dependencies
```yaml
- uses: actions/cache@v4
  with:
    path: ~/.npm
    key: ${{ runner.os }}-node-${{ hashFiles('**/package-lock.json') }}
    restore-keys: |
      ${{ runner.os }}-node-
```

### 3.3 Artifacts
```yaml
- uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
  with:
    name: coverage-report
    path: coverage/
    retention-days: 7
```

### 3.4 Environments & Protection Rules
```yaml
jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    environment: production
    steps:
      - run: ./deploy.sh
        env:
          API_KEY: ${{ secrets.PROD_API_KEY }}
```

### 3.5 Reusable Workflows
```yaml
# .github/workflows/reusable.yml
on:
  workflow_call:
    inputs:
      node-version:
        required: true
        type: string
    secrets:
      token:
        required: true
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: ${{ inputs.node-version }}
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npm test
        env:
          TOKEN: ${{ secrets.token }}
```
Guna:
```yaml
jobs:
  call-build:
    uses: ./.github/workflows/reusable.yml
    with:
      node-version: '20'
    secrets:
      token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
```

### 3.6 Self-hosted Runners
```yaml
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: self-hosted
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: ./build.sh
```

### 3.7 Security Hardening
- **Pin Actions ke SHA**: `uses: actions/checkout@a81bbbf8298c0fa03ea29cdc473d45769f953675`
- **Hadkan Permissions**: `permissions: contents: read`
- **Guna OIDC**: `permissions: id-token: write`
- **Dependabot untuk Actions**: `.github/dependabot.yml` dengan `package-ecosystem: "github-actions"`
- **CodeQL**: Guna templat CodeQL Analysis.

### 3.8 Notifications
```yaml
- uses: 8398a7/action-slack@v3
  with:
    status: ${{ job.status }}
    fields: repo,message,commit,author,action,eventName,ref,workflow
  env:
    SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL: ${{ secrets.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL }}
  if: always()
```

### 3.9 Debugging & Troubleshooting
| Masalah | Penyelesaian |
| :--- | :--- |
| Workflow tidak berjalan | Semak `on:` trigger, cawangan betul. |
| Ralat "Resource not accessible" | Tambah `permissions` dalam YAML. |
| Caching tidak berkesan | Pastikan `key` guna `hashFiles` betul. |
| Matrix terlalu besar | Guna `exclude` atau `include`. |
| Minit Actions habis | Guna caching, self-hosted runner, kurangkan `schedule`. |

