## BAHAGIAN 8: OIDC (OPENID CONNECT) UNTUK KREDENSIAL AWAN

### 8.1 Kenapa OIDC?
- **Selamat:** Tiada kredensial jangka panjang disimpan sebagai Secrets.
- **Automatik:** Kredensial sementara dijana semasa workflow berjalan.
- **Disokong:** AWS, Azure, GCP, HashiCorp Vault, dan lain-lain.

### 8.2 OIDC dengan AWS
**Langkah AWS:**
1. Cipta Identity Provider di IAM dengan URL: `https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com`
2. Cipta IAM Role dengan trust policy untuk repositori anda.
3. Beri kebenaran yang diperlukan.

**Contoh YAML:**
```yaml
permissions:
  id-token: write
  contents: read

jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Configure AWS Credentials
        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4
        with:
          role-to-assume: arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/GitHubActionsRole
          aws-region: ap-southeast-1
      - name: Deploy ke S3
        run: aws s3 sync ./dist s3://bucket-saya
```

### 8.3 OIDC dengan Google Cloud
```yaml
permissions:
  id-token: write
  contents: read

jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - id: auth
        uses: google-github-actions/auth@v2
        with:
          workload_identity_provider: 'projects/123456789/locations/global/workloadIdentityPools/github/providers/github'
          service_account: 'my-sa@project.iam.gserviceaccount.com'
      - uses: google-github-actions/setup-gcloud@v2
      - run: gcloud app deploy
```

### 8.4 OIDC dengan Azure
```yaml
permissions:
  id-token: write
  contents: read

jobs:
  deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: azure/login@v2
        with:
          client-id: ${{ secrets.AZURE_CLIENT_ID }}
          tenant-id: ${{ secrets.AZURE_TENANT_ID }}
          subscription-id: ${{ secrets.AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID }}
      - run: az webapp deploy --name myapp --resource-group myrg --src-path ./dist
```

