## BAHAGIAN 21: STRATEGI MONOREPO (PATH FILTERS & MATRIX DINAMIK)

### 21.1 Path Filters
Jalankan workflow hanya apabila fail dalam folder tertentu berubah.

```yaml
on:
  push:
    paths:
      - 'apps/web/**'
      - 'packages/ui/**'
      - '.github/workflows/web.yml'
  pull_request:
    paths:
      - 'apps/web/**'
```

### 21.2 Matrix Dinamik dari Perubahan Fail
Gunakan `dorny/paths-filter` untuk mengesan folder yang berubah, kemudian jalankan job hanya untuk pakej tersebut.

```yaml
jobs:
  changes:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    outputs:
      web: ${{ steps.filter.outputs.web }}
      api: ${{ steps.filter.outputs.api }}
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: dorny/paths-filter@v3
        id: filter
        with:
          filters: |
            web:
              - 'apps/web/**'
            api:
              - 'apps/api/**'

  build-web:
    needs: changes
    if: needs.changes.outputs.web == 'true'
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: cd apps/web && npm ci && npm test

  build-api:
    needs: changes
    if: needs.changes.outputs.api == 'true'
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: cd apps/api && npm ci && npm test
```

